---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CTA from "../components/CTA.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Features | Cleanmail" description="The mail and events that matter, sorted, and already on your calendar.">
  <section class="features-show">
    <p class="eyebrow">Features</p>
    <h1 class="show-title">Just what you need. Nothing you don't.</h1>
    <p class="show-sub">No feature dump. No 30-day grid to squint at. Here is the short list of things Cleanmail&trade; does, and does well.</p>

    <div class="marquee">
      <p class="mq-kicker">The party trick</p>
      <h2 class="mq-title">Snap the whole month. Watch it <span class="mq-accent">fill your calendar.</span></h2>
      <p class="mq-body">You know that paper month calendar the school sends home, the one that ends up buried in a backpack? Take one photo of it. Every date on it lands on your Google Calendar. No typing, no forwarding, no re-entering twelve things by hand.</p>
      <div class="mq-flow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M3 8.5h18M7 3v3M17 3v3M7.5 12h1.5M11.2 12h1.6M15 12h1.5M7.5 16h1.5M11.2 16h1.6M15 16h1.5"/></svg>
        <svg class="mq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h14M13 7l5 5-5 5"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3.5" y="5" width="17" height="15" rx="2.5"/><path d="M3.5 9.5h17M8 3.5v3M16 3.5v3M9 14l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="heroes">
      <div class="hero-feat">
        <div class="hero-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="2.5"/><rect x="6.5" y="6.5" width="11" height="2.5" rx="1.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" opacity="0.28"/><path d="M6.5 12.5h7M6.5 16h9"/></svg></div>
        <div><h3>Sorted by kid, not by sender</h3><p>One clean digest of the school, camp, and activity mail you already get, grouped by kid and then by activity. The dates you need are up top. Everything else worth knowing sits right under them, in plain language.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-feat">
        <div class="hero-ic teal"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3.5" y="5" width="17" height="15" rx="2.5"/><path d="M3.5 9.5h17M8 3.5v3M16 3.5v3"/><rect x="6" y="12.5" width="12" height="3" rx="1.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" opacity="0.28"/></svg></div>
        <div><h3>Your week, not a wall of days</h3><p>Upcoming Events shows what is actually coming up, laid out by day. No pinching, no scrolling through a month of empty squares to find the one thing that matters this Thursday.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-feat">
        <div class="hero-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/><path d="M12 8v8M8 12h8"/></svg></div>
        <div><h3>Add anything, five ways</h3><p>Type it, snap a flyer, pull it from Photos, drop in a PDF, or just say it out loud. However the detail reached you, Cleanmail turns it into an event and files it with the right kid.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-feat">
        <div class="hero-ic teal"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3.5" y="5" width="17" height="15" rx="2.5"/><path d="M3.5 9.5h17"/><path d="M9 13l-2 2 2 2M15 19l2-2-2-2M7 15h10"/></svg></div>
        <div><h3>On your Google Calendar, both ways</h3><p>Events flow onto your calendar the moment Cleanmail finds them, and the things already on your calendar flow back into your week. One source of truth, not two.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-feat">
        <div class="hero-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M3.8 19a5.2 5.2 0 0110.4 0"/><path d="M15.5 5.6a3 3 0 010 4.8"/><path d="M16.2 13.4a5.2 5.2 0 013.9 5.6"/></svg></div>
        <div><h3>Your whole household, one digest</h3><p>Up to four people share the same digest. Both parents, the sitter, whoever runs the schedule, all looking at the same week. Invite them and everyone stays on the same page, literally.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-feat">
        <div class="hero-ic teal"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6.5 16.5V11a5.5 5.5 0 1111 0v5.5l1.5 2h-14l1.5-2z"/><path d="M10 20.5a2 2 0 004 0"/></svg></div>
        <div><h3>Reminders that fit real life</h3><p>The day before, the morning of, or an hour out. Pick when each event taps you on the shoulder, so the 9am dropoff and the 5pm recital both land before you are late, not after.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="more">
      <h2>A few more things</h2>
      <p class="more-sub">Small, but they earn their place.</p>
      <div class="more-list">
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Pinned events.</b> <span>Keep the big ones stuck to the top of your digest.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Smart senders.</b> <span>Name an activity and Cleanmail finds the senders that fit, groups a company's many addresses into one, and moves a sender to another kid in a tap.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Up to three inboxes.</b> <span>Link up to three Gmail accounts into one digest.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Voice edits.</b> <span>Already have an event? Change the time just by telling it to.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Tap straight through.</b> <span>Cards from your inbox link back to the email they came from, and any address opens in maps.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Changes, shown.</b> <span>When a school moves a date, the event updates and the old time stays crossed out underneath.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>It lands when it lands.</b> <span>New mail shows up in Cleanmail as it arrives, not in tomorrow's digest.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Searchable history.</b> <span>Past digests stay searchable for the detail you need weeks later.</span></p></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="features-cta"><CTA /></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .features-show{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:54px 24px 96px}
  .features-show .eyebrow{text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--purple);margin:0 0 14px}
  .show-title{text-align:center;font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,40px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-1px;color:var(--navy);margin:14px 0 10px}
  .show-sub{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 auto 44px;max-width:560px}

  .marquee{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(74,111,227,.09),rgba(93,196,184,.11));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:34px 30px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:56px}
  .mq-kicker{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.4px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--teal);margin:0 0 10px}
  .mq-title{font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.6px;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 14px}
  .mq-accent{color:var(--purple)}
  .mq-body{font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink);margin:0 auto;max-width:560px}
  .mq-flow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;margin-top:24px;color:var(--purple)}
  .mq-flow svg{width:46px;height:46px}
  .mq-flow .mq-arrow{width:30px;height:30px;color:var(--muted)}

  .heroes{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .hero-feat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:start;padding:26px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .hero-ic{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(74,111,227,.10);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--purple);flex:0 0 auto}
  .hero-ic.teal{background:rgba(93,196,184,.15);color:var(--teal)}
  .hero-ic svg{width:28px;height:28px}
  .hero-feat h3{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin:3px 0 7px}
  .hero-feat p{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink);margin:0}

  .more{margin-top:58px}
  .more h2{text-align:center;font-size:clamp(21px,2.6vw,27px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.5px;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 6px}
  .more-sub{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin:0 0 30px}
  .more-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px 30px}
  .more-item{display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:flex-start}
  .more-item .chk{width:19px;height:19px;color:var(--teal);flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:2px}
  .more-item p{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}
  .more-item b{color:var(--navy);font-weight:600}
  .more-item span{color:var(--muted)}

  .features-cta{margin-top:60px}

  @media (max-width:640px){
    .hero-feat{grid-template-columns:48px 1fr;gap:16px;padding:22px 2px}
    .hero-ic{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px}
    .hero-ic svg{width:24px;height:24px}
    .more-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}
    .marquee{padding:28px 22px}
  }
</style>
